{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7e1b1e4e8c8bc0d35e3405f63dbb0b212a9344e0b0f4620aa31e22fc1b505e30", "ja": "（日本の文化がテーマの海外イベントに、歩と雪歩が\n招待された。ふたりはステージを披露する予定だ……）", "zh": "（步和雪步受邀参加了以日本文化为主题的海外活动。\n两人预定要在舞台上表演……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "960fc6568c377053702d0370cbf984174dac996ea733ddaea7d6378e5ff20fcd", "ja": "うわぁ……会場、すっごく盛り上がってるね！\nアタシたちも、ここで……！", "zh": "哇……会场的气氛真热烈啊！\n我们也要在这里……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1002_p", "source_sha256": "21f4b5c814725f991edc1fc0020044f4fd4937088aed85ff6cd3f53d20e3312f", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。\nもうすぐ出番だけど……準備は大丈夫か？", "zh": "嗯，说得对。\n马上就要上场了……准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "283eb62fef4c7ea9931cda078437c5fb85cc0c90e458ad6de356c33246156b23", "ja": "うん、バッチリ♪\nこの日のために、雪歩といっぱい練習してきたしね！", "zh": "嗯，准备得万无一失♪  \n为了这一天，我还和雪步进行了好多练习呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d1f0cb36fe420563b4c6e0a740f254cffeffeae01cc9d121fff85baab36b6ef5", "ja": "それに、海外でパフォーマンスする機会って、\nあんまりないでしょ？　へへっ、楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "而且，在海外表演的机会也不多吧？嘿嘿，真期待啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1005_p", "source_sha256": "17492761d7fa98090fb6bdf631e35702825fc62d4fbd429bc7aba473a66e970c", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。しかしダンスに、能や狂言、\n日舞の動きを取り入れたのは、いい案だったな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。不过，把能乐、狂言和日本舞的动作融入舞蹈，确实是个好主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "01c1df20604abb7d0a3bb67f1254556791bfbb3fe1a7a47abb90a1e07db79cb7", "ja": "えへへっ、でしょ♪　いつものダンスとは違って、\n『華やかな日本の舞』って感じ？", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吧♪ 和平时的舞蹈不一样，有种“华丽的日本舞蹈”的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "26d561909f182a50d8dcecb6b6f55c0c00ee13f3b1e12c816ea507ca5ed117c7", "ja": "雪歩と、レッスン中にアイディアを出し合ったんだ。\n「世界の人から見た日本らしさは何だろう？」って。", "zh": "我和雪步在练习的时候一起想了不少点子。我们还讨论了“在世界各地的人眼中，日本特色是什么呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bee51f5ef212d99eb5c9a92ad4dab57f9ad9baefc9de6f21174e422590cc2db1", "ja": "ステージで使う小物とか衣装だけじゃなくて、\n演出にも和の要素を取り入れたいねってさ。", "zh": "不只是舞台上使用的小道具和服装，演出中也想融入和风元素呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1009_p", "source_sha256": "24563fcbe07e95aad36358057a0dae03b38e773952dcb2e15b29fdbf17d4db9a", "ja": "なるほど。それで、プロジェクションマッピングを\n提案したのか。おかげで四季の表現が明確になったよ。", "zh": "原来如此。所以，你才提议使用投影映射啊。多亏了这个，四季的表现也变得更鲜明了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "63b1ff5bb702a4cc6b443468c792a3dc12eb86e8e04257f9325fe6562245cfff", "ja": "そうだよね。でも、そのアイディアを思いついたのも、\n雪歩と一緒だったからかも！", "zh": "是啊。不过，能想到那个点子，或许也是因为和雪步一起吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8c9366da2ed72d06292d41ac4d4f4f13fb0e6675470eb4ca51cc6093179782d9", "ja": "雪歩ってさ。お茶が好きだったり、おしとやかな\n雰囲気もあって、『ザ・和の心』って感じじゃない？", "zh": "说到雪步啊。她喜欢茶，还有那种娴静的气质，不觉得很有“日本风情”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1012_p", "source_sha256": "803d4cb92bd31d4f60ed885e8a255b5679cba0bfb49aaee3e8598bc62a1d74bf", "ja": "『ザ・和の心』かはわからないが……。\n雪歩は、和の雰囲気がよく似合うとは思うよ。", "zh": "不知道算不算“真正的和之心”……  \n不过我觉得，雪步确实很适合和风的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fc083352b84ee76a7c19301b10cd2f18a166154fb228be1f65cd37018859faa4", "ja": "でしょ？　雪歩の丁寧なダンスを見てたら、\nアタシもアイディアがいっぱい湧いてきてさ。", "zh": "对吧？看着雪步优雅细致的舞蹈，我也一下子涌出了好多灵感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4f4f5d2312c4de0adbdb7b9fd73d80e280538941d6edb61a97d8458c2fcd300f", "ja": "今日のステージ、いい感じに仕上がってると思う！\n{$P$}、本番も楽しみにしてて♪", "zh": "我觉得今天的舞台准备得很不错！  \n{$P$}，正式演出也要期待一下哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6f410f32e29f2365ea44028dbcab9240c590e53e87f63fc7308819dd1694241e", "ja": "日本の代表として……アイドルの代表として……\n世界中に、ジャパンカルチャーを伝えてくるよ！", "zh": "作为日本的代表……作为偶像的代表……\n我要把日本文化传遍全世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1016_p", "source_sha256": "47da5f0fd41098b07e71cd23373b98eb310459980c2350bb120a3c1f4b41a064", "ja": "ああ、頼んだぞ！\n歩たちの魅力で、世界の人たちを夢中にさせるんだ！", "zh": "啊，拜托你了！\n用步她们的魅力，让全世界的人都为之着迷吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1eaea12857a5796f953dbfaaf95eee1ba2b3daa44f0c4498f540328b3e446b10", "ja": "へへっ♪　……あっ。そろそろ時間みたい！\nそれじゃ行ってくるね、{$P$}！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪……啊，好像差不多到时间了！\n那我先走啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0394_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3a0fea715efcb0f311c1238c75f1d28ed9744d1cda030a3b8530bd8583619fbb", "ja": "（日本らしさ溢れる歩たちのステージは、大成功！\n会場にいるたくさんの人を釘付けにしていた！）", "zh": "（充满日本风情的步她们的舞台大获成功！牢牢吸引了会场内众多观众！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
